# Docker builds Linux images from these files: shell scripts and Dockerfiles must keep LF line endings even when
# the repo is cloned on Windows with core.autocrlf=true (a CRLF shebang gives "exec ./entrypoint.sh: no such file").
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
